                        "rating":  5,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "This art-filled café features unique coffee bean containers and artistic bean labels. Manager Huang and Store Manager You were incredibly welcoming and provided detailed explanations of everything. Enjoying coffee is an art form; standing next to the professional brewer, inhaling the aroma and listening to his explanations of brewing techniques was truly delightful.\n\nThe coffee\u0027s flavor changes with temperature, rich and sweet, with aromas lingering in the nose and throat, and a persistent sweet aftertaste… The desserts were also amazing, both beautiful and delicious!\n\nEverything was so wonderful—a fantastic little coffee journey!",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "充滿藝術氣息的咖啡廳，咖啡豆的容器很特別、豆標很藝術，黃經理和尤店長都非常熱情又詳細的介紹所有相關的一切，品咖啡的藝術饗宴，站在專業沖泡師旁，聞著咖啡香聽他說明沖泡的技巧，好享受。\n咖啡入口，不同溫度不同口感，醇厚甘甜、香氣在鼻腔和喉間迴盪，回甘持續著…...\n甜點也是令人驚豔，好看又好吃！\n一切都是這麼的美好，很棒的咖啡小旅程！",
                                             "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
                                         },
