                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "Go the specialty coffee route\nPremium Cru coffee beans are around 600-700/cup\nThere are also afternoon tea sets for those who love sweets.\nThe service staff are very professional. They will help customers choose whatever flavor they like. I will come to this store again.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "走精品咖啡路線\nPremium Cru 的咖啡豆大約6-700/杯\n也有下午茶組合給愛甜食的朋友們\n服務人員都超專業，喜歡什麼口味的都會幫客人挑選，會想再來的店",
                                             "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
