                    {
                        "name":  "places/ChIJP9MYKDWtQjQR0SUQGZ4HRAA/reviews/ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUR6b2FDcFdnEAE",
                        "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "a year ago",
                        "rating":  5,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "If you\u0027re a connoisseur and a passionate hand-drip coffee enthusiast, you should try this place to experience the pinnacle of hand-drip coffee prices in Taipei! Eight people can spend over NT$20,000 on coffee – a truly unique experience!\n\nThis is the only overseas branch of Mi Cafeto from Japan. The founder traveled the world seeking out the best coffees, using the most scientific and luxurious methods to preserve their optimal flavor. Many coffee professionals may not agree, but their approach and rituals reveal how precious coffee is to another group of people, like gold!\n\nRemember, picking out a bottle of vacuum-packed coffee beans isn\u0027t really the point; enjoying it on the spot is the best way to experience it! Especially the professional hand-drip style of the Japanese baristas – classic!",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "如果你是老饕，又是手沖咖啡的狂熱份子，應該來這試試台北手沖咖啡價格的天花板！八個人喝咖啡可以喝超過新台幣兩萬，十分特別的體驗！\n\n這裡是日本 Mi Cafeto 海外的唯一分店，創辦人在全世界獵奇他心中的好咖啡，透過最科學、也是奢侈的方法保存咖啡最佳味道，或許很多咖啡從業者不認同，不過，透過他們對待咖啡的方法、儀式讓人明白，咖啡在另一群人眼中如此珍貴，好比黃金！\n\n記得，來這挑一瓶真空咖啡豆沒太大意義，在當場喝才是王道！尤其日籍咖啡師的專業手沖風格，經典！",
                                             "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
                                         },
